& [Purpose] is inspectable deterministic release material
  + convert each proven root draft into one locally closed schema document
  + make exact generated structure reviewable as five goldens and one bundle envelope
  + supply content identity for later conformance and compatibility work without asserting either

& [Prerequisite] is exact
  + consume an atomic pair of CPMS-I02B input_deserialize and output_serialize universes
  + require equal profile, generator id, supplied source revision, and limits across both universes
  + require the exact closed assignment prepare, run, verify, base response, and preparation response with no missing or extra root

& [DocumentIdentity] is direction qualified
  + one document identity is direction plus root kind plus semantic type name plus stable schema id
  + prepare_input, run_input, and verify_input are input_deserialize
  + base_response and preparation_response are output_serialize
  + every identity is unique even when pre-materialization root bytes are equal

& [Materialization] is self contained
  + root draft must be an object without $id or $defs
  + $schema must be absent or exactly https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema
  + set the exact dialect and root draft schema_id
  + insert one $defs object containing every and only definition in the root's transitive closure from its same-direction universe
  + independently rescan the result and require every local reference resolves and the closure is exact
  + no external, relative-document, opposite-direction, unused, or unresolved definition is admitted

& [CanonicalBytes] reuse one algorithm
  + call the I02B generated-Value canonical writer
  + sort object keys by Unicode scalar sequence, preserve arrays, retain scalar spelling, and emit compact UTF-8
  + do not parse untrusted bytes and make no duplicate-key rejection claim
  + document digest is SHA-256 of exact canonical schema bytes after dialect, id, and definitions are present

& [DocumentRecord] is strict metadata outside the schema value
  + carry direction, root kind, semantic type, schema id, schema value, root fingerprint, universe fingerprint, resources, residual ids, canonical byte length, document digest, and document fingerprint
  + document fingerprint domain binds all identity and lineage fields plus document digest
  + no Cantor-private or provider-private schema keyword is inserted

& [BundlePayload] is complete before hashing
  + carry profile, dialect, generator, supplied source revision, exact limits, two direction-qualified universe fingerprints and resource accounts, and all five document records
  + document map order is the lexical serialized root-kind token order
  + direction inventories preserve definition names, contract fingerprints, and aggregate accounts without becoming a sixth schema root
  + unknown, duplicate, missing, extra, mixed, or inconsistent members fault atomically

& [BundleDigest] avoids self-reference
  + canonicalize the payload before any digest field exists
  + enforce the maximum canonical bundle bytes on payload and final envelope
  + compute a domain-separated payload digest from exact canonical payload bytes
  + exact-baseline fingerprint binds payload digest plus ordered document identities, fingerprints, and digests

& [GoldenProjection] is pure and fixed
  + return a BTreeMap-equivalent in-memory path-to-bytes projection with exactly six entries
  + five document paths are direction.root-kind.schema.json and contain exact canonical schema bytes
  + public_procedure_machine_schema.bundle.json contains the canonical final bundle envelope
  + projection performs no filesystem access; checked-in files are byte-equality fixtures, never independently edited authority

& [ExactReplay] is the only I02C compatibility result
  + equal baseline fingerprint and independently recomputed payload and document digests yields identical
  + any mismatch yields a typed exact-replay fault with path and expected and observed digest where safe
  + changed documents are unclassified and release-blocking until later same-direction compatibility analysis
  + no compatible or breaking semantic classification is inferred in I02C

& [Bounds] retain profile 0.1
  + each canonical document is at most 4194304 bytes
  + canonical payload and final bundle envelope are each at most 16777216 bytes
  + definition, reference, depth, property, alternative, and residual ceilings remain enforced after materialization
  + exact document, payload, and envelope footprints become golden test facts only after implementation

& [Faults] are closed and nonpartial
  + invalid universe pair, root set, direction, root object, dialect, schema id, reserved-key collision, closure, local reference, digest, baseline, artifact table, golden bytes, or limit
  + safe path, optional expected and observed values, and bounded message identify the failure
  + failure returns no partially authoritative document, bundle, baseline, or artifact set

& [PublicSurfaceCandidate] is feature gated and pure
  + CanonicalMachineSchemaDocument, MachineSchemaBundlePayload, MachineSchemaGoldenBundle, exact replay result, and closed fault forms
  + materialize one document, materialize atomic bundle, project in-memory artifacts, and verify exact replay
  + no default-feature dependency or behavior change

& [SourceTouchCandidate] is narrow
  + tool lib.rs, schema_generation.rs reuse visibility, new schema_documents.rs, and new machine_schema_documents.rs test
  + six new golden JSON fixtures under the procedure-tool test tree
  + governance and metadata-only evidence records may accompany a separately signed completion
  + no Cargo, core, CLI, MCP, service, ecosystem, Windows, runtime, provider, model, network, effect, or hardware source

& [Proof] is layered
  + deterministic repeated generation, canonical rescan, exact local closure, unique ids, and exact golden bytes
  + base and preparation raw-root equality plus canonical-document inequality
  + missing extra mixed conflicting tampered stale one-byte drift and one-below-bound refusals
  + complete default debug and release suites plus all-feature format, check, lint, build, docs, audit, diff, source-boundary, and evidence-freshness gates

& [AuthorityBoundary] is formation only
  + implementation requires exact hashes, completed-work review, a separately signed activation, and a phase lock
  - never: I03 byte parser, duplicate-key claim, instance validator, serde conformance corpus, residual execution, changed-schema compatibility classification, I04 tool definition, provider, model, service, runtime persistence, network, effect, production, hardware, or FPGA

& [SignatureCandidate] is formed not activated
  + [candidate_signature_uuid] is 5f6850d2-fe62-4851-af54-a1a410830cd4
  + [activation_condition] is exact canonical hash, source-touch hash, measured prerequisite replay, golden-generation procedure, adversarial review, and separate CPMS-I02C claim
